  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SADC Secretariat - Capacity and Institutional Strengthening Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed activities in the IDF Grant are designed to contribute to the development and strengthening of the SADC Secretariat which is charged with implementation of the Regional Indicative Strategic Development Plan. They are aimed at addressing the organizational challenges that the Secretariat faces, with particular emphasis on the need to: prepare programs and projects; develop multi-year plans and budgets as requested by the Member States; and reduce the administrative burden by harmonizing procedures. Coordination of the grant activities will be assured by the Chief Director (CD) and staff.  To assist SADC in strengthening its capacity to implement its policy agenda and investment program</narrative>
  </description>
